{
  "_comment": "One entry per matrix variant. packages: added to the variant project's manifest (versions are the ones the verified runs used; raise them deliberately). pipeline: builtin | urp3d | urp2d | hdrp. colorSpace: gamma | linear. input: legacy | new | both (Active Input Handling).",
  "unity": "6000.3.25f1",
  "variants": {
